BAKR: Welcome to Mars, Cobra One. The superweapon we discovered on the moon is being developed somewhere near here; it's a massive tank called the Mammoth. You're going to need to find out where it is first; there's a hangar just up ahead, and your suit should be able to tap into its communications so we can listen in. Mind the radar towers; if you stay too close for too long they'll realise you're not one of theirs and bring all manner of hell down on you. Good luck, sir.